  },
  {
   "id": "markdown",
   "relation": "family"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "0": "Org is implemented in Emacs Lisp and ships with Emacs; links use the GitHub emacs-mirror (canonical repository at git.savannah.gnu.org / git.sr.ht).",
  "1": "\"Org Syntax\" on Worg is the closest thing to a specification and is kept in sync with org-element.el; the Org Manual documents behaviour."
 },
